# UI rules

- Tokens live in `app/globals.css` (`@theme inline`). There is **no**
  `tailwind.config.ts`. Read `.ai/specs/design-system.md` before styling.
- Reuse `components/ui/*` (Button, Card, Dialog, Tabs, Badge, Heading, Input,
  Label, IconTile, StatusBadge, UserAvatar, AvatarPicker, ConfirmDialog,
  Collapsible, Toast). Merge classes with `cn()`.
- `variant="primary"` is the magenta→red CTA gradient — reserved for primary CTAs
  and critical actions.
- `'use client'` is required for Dexie/liveQuery, Zustand, browser APIs, Radix
  portals, DnD, and media capture. Server components must never import a
  repository or `lib/db`/`lib/sync`.
- Data access goes through hooks: `useDatabase`, `useSyncStatus`, feature
  `use-*` hooks, or repository `watch*` methods inside `useEffect`.
- All copy via `useI18n().t()`; keys must exist in both `en` and `es`
  (`lib/i18n/i18n-coverage.test.ts` enforces parity).
- 44×44px touch targets (`h-11`/`size-11`); visible focus rings; Radix handles
  keyboard/focus/Esc.
- Portaled content inside dialogs needs `isDialogDismissExempt()`.
- Hydration: never read `localStorage` during render (theme/language are applied
  post-mount).
